#tr.en: you mix it in one liter of fine-quality oil, 
6'. szi-ip-tam ta-na-di#-i-ma? [x] ta#-sza-qi2-szu 
#tr.en: recite an incantation, and make him drink it. 
7'. a-na sa-ma-nim x x x ir-bi-tim u3 ir-ra-[am] 
#tr.en: for samanu-disease . . . four . . . and colocynth 
